@startuml
actor User
participant WebView
participant Android
participant "Auth Tab" as Browser
participant Google
participant "Existing Auth.js backend" as Backend
User -> WebView: Continue with Google
WebView -> Backend: Existing CSRF / sign-in requests
Backend -> WebView: Auth.js PKCE cookies + Google authorization URL
WebView -> Android: Intercept Google main-frame navigation
Android -> Browser: Launch AuthTabIntent, expect existing HTTPS callback
Browser -> Google: Existing authorization request
Google -> User: Account and consent UI
Google -> Browser: Redirect to /api/auth/callback/google
Browser -> Android: ActivityResult containing callback URI
Android -> WebView: Load validated URI in initiating WebView
WebView -> Backend: Existing callback + original Auth.js cookies
Backend -> Google: Standard provider code exchange
Google -> Backend: Provider tokens
Backend -> WebView: Normal session cookie + redirect /notes
@enduml
